          "id": 2731178518,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "While computations involving unsigned integers do not overflow or underflow, the C23 checked integer arithmetic (modeled on GCC) returns `true` when there has been wraparound for unsigned much as it does when there has been overflow or underflow with signed integers.",
