        {
          "id": 2731251960,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I meant unsigned \"integer underflow\" as defined in [CWE-191: Integer Underflow (Wrap or Wraparound)](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/191.html), not as defined ~~out of existence~~ by C18. :smile:\n\nLet me know if I should rework this MR to use the checked arithmetic functions.  Seems straightforward enough, but yeah, it would introduce that dependency on #20144 for backports (should that be required).",
          "author": {
