        {
          "id": 2731311992,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "And to quote C23, \"A computation involving unsigned operands can never produce an overflow, because arithmetic for the unsigned type is performed modulo 2<sup>_N_</sup>.\" The C23 description of the checked arithmetic macros says:\n\n> These type-generic macros perform addition, subtraction, or multiplication of the mathematical values of **a** and **b**, storing the result of the operation in **\\*result**, (that is, **\\*result** is assigned the result of computing **a + b**, **a - b**, or **a * b**).Each operation is performed as if both operands were represented in a signed integer type with infinite range, and the result was then converted from this integer type to _type1_.\n\nAt least as I read that, if the packet length is 1, 1 - 3 would be computed as -2; C23 6.3.2.3 \"Signed and unsigned integers\" say\n\n> When a value with integer type is converted to another integer type other than bool, if the value can be represented by the new type, it is unchanged.\n> \n> Otherwise, if the new type is unsigned, the value is converted by repeatedly adding or subtracting one more than the maximum value that can be represented in the new type until the value is in the range of the new type.\n\nso it sounds as if -3 would get 2^32 added to it, giving 4294967293, and that's what would be stored.\n\n> C23 checked integer arithmetic (modeled on GCC) returns `true` when there has been wraparound for unsigned\n\nIs that explicitly stated somewhere?",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-09-04T23:10:28.199Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-09-11T06:33:33.708Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 412622047,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
