        {
          "id": 2732502994,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think it probably should fail (it issues a pragma warning.) It doesn't matter for our case because in the CMake configuration we fail if the compiler doesn't support C11 and C++11.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
