        {
          "id": 2743868893,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "For now, committing and backporting this seems to be the right thing to do.\n\nReplacing \"check before subtracting\" with \"do checked subtraction and check the result of he check\" is a separate project, as this is far from the only \"check before subtracting\" case in Wireshark.",
